    `$why` is NOT required on them and `$source` IS.

  · Each of the three kinds resolves against THE FILE THAT IS ITS HOME
    (ADR-0017 write-once), never a second registry — the same shape role:/intent:/
    shape: use, and the same shape s276-D3 used for rule:/ux:.

